  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "RofIj4sZV9DjbDrfRGABE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 761.4119388707838,
      "y": -239.2508051470943,
      "width": 919.7264446666418,
      "height": 2225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1626964504,
      "version": 1937,
      "versionNonce": 1235441591,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795271588044,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Startup\n- 20 ppl\n- 1 Team of GIS engs\n- Fullstack devs\n- AI engineers\n\nProduct\n- Target Audience: Farmers\n- Goal: Identify bad crops\n- Hardware: \n   - Commercial off the shelve drones\n   - Drones have SDK\n   - Good cameras\n- IP\n   - Object detection model\n\n\nQuestions\n- Only prodcut\n- Payload possible, but not there yet\n- SDK enables some logic in Drone or GroundStation\n- High-end models have infra-red\n- Scale\n-- PoC phase\n-- Analysis required (to start 1000 farmers)\n\nFunctional requirements\n1. Manage Mission profiles\n2. Process and analyze images\n3. View Results\n\n-- Out of scope --\n- CICD / Ecosystem\n- Model training\n- Auth\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- Avaiability > Consistency for FR2\n- Consistency > Availablity for FR1 + FR3\n- Writes >> Read\n- Physical safety\n\nEntities\n- Drone (SDK)\n- GroundStation (SDK)\n- Field\n- MissionProfile\n- Mission\n- MissionResult\n\nBack of the envelope\n- 1Mio farmer\n- 1M per day\n- 2000 images per Mission, 1MB\n- Storage: Much\n- RPS: 1Mio * 1M * 2000 = 2000M / 100000 = 20.000 RPS\n\nAPI Design\nPOST /missionprofiles\nPartial<MissionProfile>\nPUT /missionprofiles/:mpId\nGET /missionprofiles -> MissionProfile[]\n\nPOST /missions -> missionId\n{\n    missionProfileId: ..\n}\n\nGET /missions/:mId -> Mission\nGET /missions/:id/result -> MissionResult\n\nMQTT\n\nAnaylzeImage -> MQTT\n{\n position: LatLng\n elevation: double\n imageId: string\n}\n\nControlMessage <- MQTT\n{\n    action: \"AbortMission\n}\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Startup\n- 20 ppl\n- 1 Team of GIS engs\n- Fullstack devs\n- AI engineers\n\nProduct\n- Target Audience: Farmers\n- Goal: Identify bad crops\n- Hardware: \n   - Commercial off the shelve drones\n   - Drones have SDK\n   - Good cameras\n- IP\n   - Object detection model\n\n\nQuestions\n- Only prodcut\n- Payload possible, but not there yet\n- SDK enables some logic in Drone or GroundStation\n- High-end models have infra-red\n- Scale\n-- PoC phase\n-- Analysis required (to start 1000 farmers)\n\nFunctional requirements\n1. Manage Mission profiles\n2. Process and analyze images\n3. View Results\n\n-- Out of scope --\n- CICD / Ecosystem\n- Model training\n- Auth\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- Avaiability > Consistency for FR2\n- Consistency > Availablity for FR1 + FR3\n- Writes >> Read\n- Physical safety\n\nEntities\n- Drone (SDK)\n- GroundStation (SDK)\n- Field\n- MissionProfile\n- Mission\n- MissionResult\n\nBack of the envelope\n- 1Mio farmer\n- 1M per day\n- 2000 images per Mission, 1MB\n- Storage: Much\n- RPS: 1Mio * 1M * 2000 = 2000M / 100000 = 20.000 RPS\n\nAPI Design\nPOST /missionprofiles\nPartial<MissionProfile>\nPUT /missionprofiles/:mpId\nGET /missionprofiles -> MissionProfile[]\n\nPOST /missions -> missionId\n{\n    missionProfileId: ..\n}\n\nGET /missions/:mId -> Mission\nGET /missions/:id/result -> MissionResult\n\nMQTT\n\nAnaylzeImage -> MQTT\n{\n position: LatLng\n elevation: double\n imageId: string\n}\n\nControlMessage <- MQTT\n{\n    action: \"AbortMission\n}\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
